# Optional. Your practice's Client Portal address — either the slug or the
# full host. You do NOT need to set this: the sign-in link your provider
# emails is https://<practice>.clientsecure.me/sign-in/token#<TOKEN>, so
# pasting the whole link into simplepractice_verify_sign_in_token tells the
# server which practice to use, and the stored session remembers it.
# Set it only to pin this server to one practice.
# SIMPLEPRACTICE_PRACTICE=achievebalancetherapy

# Optional. Where to persist the signed-in session (written 0600).
# Deliberately NOT ~/.simplepractice-cookies, which the simplepractice-fpx
# skill uses for its curl cookie jar.
# SIMPLEPRACTICE_SESSION_FILE=~/.simplepractice-mcp/session.json
